    <briefdescription>
<para>Regex-based deontic logic extractor for German legal texts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements Phase 1 of the legal ingestion pipeline using pattern matching. The extractor is fully injectable: supply a custom extract function via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_deontic_extractor_1a9650ade60a9b7a709d6c14b213eae508" kindref="member">setExtractorFn()</ref></computeroutput> to override the default regex implementation (useful in tests or when wiring an LLM adapter in Phase 2).</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_deontic_extractor_1a024d360944bd1a10344c470277a29c62" kindref="member">DeonticExtractor</ref><sp/>extractor;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">extractor.setConfidenceThreshold(0.75);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>extractor.extract(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Wer<sp/>Anlagen<sp/>betreiben<sp/>will,<sp/>bedarf<sp/>einer<sp/>Genehmigung.&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>result.primaryCategory()<sp/>==<sp/>DeonticCategory::OBLIGATION</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
